{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53873","headline":"寄刘环中秀才 · 张文规","name":"寄刘环中秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"待醉乌程酒，思斟平望羹。\n烟云金斗暗，苔藓石尊平。\n（见宋程大昌《演繁露续集》卷四引《顾渚茶录》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文规","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}